<TEI xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0" xml:id="CH2b1559-zh-10ebba6f" type="transl"><teiHeader><fileDesc><titleStmt><title>《聲無哀樂論。今譯</title><editor role="translator">Liu Zaisheng 劉再生</editor></titleStmt><publicationStmt><ab>published electronically as part of the TLS project at https://hxwd.org</ab><availability status="2"><ab>This work has been licensed for use in the TLS</ab></availability></publicationStmt><sourceDesc><bibl><title>《聲無哀樂論。今譯</title>音樂藝術 I, 2000，pp. 7-13,2026</bibl><ab>Translation of <bibl corresp="#CH2b1559"><title xml:lang="och"/></bibl> into <lang xml:lang="zh">modern Chinese</lang>.</ab></sourceDesc></fileDesc><profileDesc><creation resp="#CH">Initially created: <date>2026-05-28T00:53:52.123+09:00</date> by CH</creation></profileDesc></teiHeader><text><body><div><head>Translated parts</head><p xml:id="CH2b1559-start"><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.3" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T00:56:54.645+09:00">“秦客”间“东野主人”：</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.4" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T00:57:14.331+09:00">以前常说</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.5" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T00:57:18.321+09:00">“治世之音安以乐．</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.6" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T00:57:22.667+09:00">亡国之音哀以思”，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.7" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T00:57:36.801+09:00">国家的安定或混乱在于政治．</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.8" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T00:57:48.115+09:00">音乐只是反映了这种现象而已，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.9" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T00:57:56.943+09:00">所以无论悲哀忧虑</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.10" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T00:58:18.283+09:00">或安详欢乐的感情都会表现于金石管弦之中 </seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.11" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T00:58:30.325+09:00"/><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.13" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T00:59:22.663+09:00">再如孔子听《韶》乐。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.14" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T00:59:29.001+09:00">理解了虞舜的德行；</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.15" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T00:59:40.087+09:00">季札观乐，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.16" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T16:37:16.86+09:00">能够识别各地民谣的特点。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.17" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T16:37:28.997+09:00">这些既成事实，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.18" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T16:37:35.95+09:00">有识之士从不怀疑。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.19" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T16:40:36.491+09:00">现在惟独先生提出了“声无哀乐”的观点，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.20" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T16:40:59.199+09:00">根据何在呢?如有高见．</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.22" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T16:42:44.436+09:00">愿洗耳恭聽。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.23" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T16:44:40.721+09:00">主人”说：</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.24" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T16:46:14.266+09:00">体说的道理太陈旧了．</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.25" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T16:46:22.955+09:00">已经无可教药，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.26" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T16:48:03.01+09:00">使得后世</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.27" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T16:48:09.242+09:00">都混淆了名稗与本质的关系：</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.28" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T16:48:24.241+09:00">承蒙体启导．</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.29" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T16:48:44.801+09:00">我就略说一二吧。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.30" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T16:49:09.873+09:00">天地之气融合于一起，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.31" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T16:49:22.811+09:00">于是产生了世间万物 </seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.32" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T16:49:38.664+09:00">春夏秋冬、寒来暑往．</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.33" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T16:49:56.555+09:00">进而形成金、术、水、火、土的五行学说，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.34" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T16:50:11.237+09:00">视觉有红、黄、蓝、白、黑“五色 ．</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.35" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T16:50:52.589+09:00">听觉有宫，商、角、徽、羽“五音 。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.36" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T16:51:08.396+09:00">音乐的作用，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.37" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T16:51:51.903+09:00">好象存在于天地之间的空气</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.38" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T16:51:56.77+09:00">一样 它的好与不好．</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.39" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T16:52:06.093+09:00">虽然遭到污浊与混乱的侵蚀．</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.40" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T16:52:37.54+09:00">其本质依然</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.41" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T16:52:44.195+09:00">不会改变— — </seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.42" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T16:52:57.067+09:00">音乐难道会因为人的喜爱与憎恶</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.43" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T16:53:06.174+09:00">而改变曲调 悲哀与快乐而改变律度吗?</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.44" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T16:53:14.666+09:00">至于乐音组织成旋律．</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.45" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T16:53:21.005+09:00">使声音极其和谐．</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.46" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T16:53:30.183+09:00">乃是人们追求的理想，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.47" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T16:54:03.309+09:00">也是情欲的需要。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.48" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T16:54:17.732+09:00">古人知道感情不可放纵，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.49" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T16:54:22.816+09:00">欲望不能过度，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.50" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T16:56:10.481+09:00">所以需要音乐时</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.51" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T16:56:15.392+09:00">总是有节制地使用．</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.52" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T16:56:24.424+09:00">使之悲哀而不伤害身心，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.53" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T16:56:30.655+09:00">快乐而不至于荒淫；</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.54" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T16:56:46.515+09:00">名称因事而起．每种事物都有称号：</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.55" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T16:57:43.847+09:00">哭泣叫做“哀”．</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.56" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T16:57:49.866+09:00">歌唱叫做“乐”，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.57" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T17:00:11.849+09:00"/><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.58" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T17:00:19.483+09:00">这是它们大致的区别。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.59" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T17:00:47.416+09:00">然而，孔子说的“音乐啊，音乐啊 </seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.60" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T17:00:58.012+09:00">难道有钟有鼓就是音乐吗? </seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.61" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T17:01:49.963+09:00">那么同样可以说．悲哀啊，悲哀啊，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.62" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T17:02:02.674+09:00">难道哭泣就完全等同于悲哀吗?</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.63" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T17:02:11.607+09:00">依此而言．</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.64" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T17:02:21.641+09:00">有玉有帛并非是札教的实质，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.65" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T17:02:43.389+09:00">有歌有舞也并非是哀乐的本源。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.66" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T17:02:48.936+09:00">如何解释呢?</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.67" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T21:03:06.674+09:00">各地风俗不同，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.68" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T21:03:19.327+09:00">歌唱和哭泣的含义就不一样，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.69" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T21:11:50.421+09:00">假如理解错了 </seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.70" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T21:12:20.896+09:00">或者昕剜哭泣而欢乐起来，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.71" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T21:12:35.42+09:00">或者听了歌唱反而哭泣；</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.72" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-28T21:14:43.002+09:00">然而，人们悲哀或快乐的感情本质是一样的。</seg></p></div></body></text></TEI>